					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ne diutius mireris, amicorum incomparabilis, cur scribendi ad te officium tam diu <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>intermiserim, scito me iam pridem statuisse in dies iter ad vos arripere meque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>vivam fore epistolam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum, cum <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName> milites ante duos fere menses <placeName ref="l245">Kauffbuͤ<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>rnam</placeName> ingressi essent, miseram alioqui plebeculam molestaturi, non licuit mihi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>domum meam deserere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cumque ipsis tritis istic 6 septimanis tandem hinc <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>solvissent nihilque periculi amplius ex illis imminere videbatur, ego <placeName ref="l907">Campidu<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>num</placeName> usque <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> visitaturus veneram, ecce per feredarium certior <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fio <placeName ref="l875">Hispanos</placeName> ex improviso <placeName ref="l245">Kauffburnam</placeName> rediisse sturmatimque, ut dicitur, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>primo impetu in aedes meas irruisse, uxorem, liberos et generum meum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ex diversoriis suis sub tegulas quasi cedere coegisse, me quesiisse et min<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>as feroces sparsisse propter nescio quas calumnias, quibus ingratum et <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>cęcum vulgus, ut audio, mihi imposuit, ita ut ne domi quidem meę tutus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sim neque consultum sit longius a familia proficisci, donec audiam, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quo tragedię huius finis tendat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Delitescendum igitur mihi destinavi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>hinc inde et consyderandum, remne fuga an alio quopiam consilio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>agam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Omnino autem deo duce hac estate <persName ref="p495">Bullingerum</persName> meum invisam; ipse <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dominum pro me orat, ne supra vires me tentari sinat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Erectus porro <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dei benignitate atque constans in pietatis proposito sum, utut mundus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>insaniat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tu tecum inito rationem, quomodo <persName ref="p8354">Lętus</persName> cum suis reliquum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>huius vitę curriculum instituat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> adhuc inconcussi violencię obsistunt dantque argumenta <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>diuturnę perseverancię; ego vero illis propter non satis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>puram religionem timeo, spero tamen dominum ipsis, si conscientiis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>bonis ita ambulant, miserturum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Princeps <placeName ref="l875">Hispaniarum</placeName> hinc properat abiissetque iam, nisi pyratę, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ut fama est, iter insecurum fęcissent.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p18538">Cęsare</persName> scribere ne <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>verbum quidem licet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominos <persName ref="p21096">Blaureros</persName> fratres, <persName ref="p4082">Zviccium</persName>, simmistas <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tuos, dominos consules, item <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName>, <persName ref="p4637">Diterichum</persName> in Ror univers<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>osque bonos, presertim exquestorem illum exulem, salvos esse cupio; <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>vide, ne <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> meum pretereas.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l907">Campiduni</placeName> 14. <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>maii 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">G[eorgius] L[<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>aetus</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>antistiti ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino et amico incomparabili <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>